@startuml
' Lecturer Support Agent — editable PlantUML source
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
title Lesson Plan Generation
actor Lecturer
participant UI
participant Authorization as Auth
participant Orchestrator as AI
participant "Source Verifier" as Sources
participant "Teaching Service" as Teach
participant "Version Service" as Version
Lecturer -> UI : Generate 2-hour IoT sensor practical
UI -> Auth : verify lecturer/module scope
Auth --> UI : authorised context
UI -> AI : prompt + constraints + context
AI -> Sources : retrieve current sources if needed
Sources --> AI : verified evidence or limitations
AI -> Teach : build lesson artifact schema
Teach --> AI : outcomes, timing, equipment, activities, assessment
AI -> Version : save draft and sources
Version --> AI : immutable version ID
AI --> UI : stream lesson inline
Lecturer -> UI : edit/adapt/export
@enduml
